        "excerpt": "其先舜司徒虎之後，高祖黯，曾祖茂琳，祖信，父誠。",
        "title": "《旧五代史》 · 卷 1 · 梁太祖纪1"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "duan-ning-meiren-siblings",
    "from": "duan-ning",
    "to": "liang-duan-ning-sister-meiren",
    "kind": "kinship",
    "label": "兄妹",
    "note": "段凝原名段明远；只登记明确兄妹，不补妹妹个人名。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v45",
        "paragraphId": "new-v45-p39",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "ef6c6c53c100150e366eb2f7ed6c9cdc5dca95bc30d4b98f610c0ffc8e66b7f5",
        "excerpt": "段凝，開封人也。初名明遠，後更名凝。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 45 · 杂传"
      },
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v45",
        "paragraphId": "new-v45-p39",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "ef6c6c53c100150e366eb2f7ed6c9cdc5dca95bc30d4b98f610c0ffc8e66b7f5",
        "excerpt": "又以其妹內太祖，妹有色，後為美人。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 45 · 杂传"
      },
      {
        "chapterId": "tongjian-v268",
        "paragraphId": "tongjian-v268-p24",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "d1f49cb0098fb1198b5ce16a94a2603393aff4cb69751b8c76f3f7a0e1f1d6a4",
        "excerpt": "懷州刺史開封段明遠妹為美人。",
        "title": "《资治通鉴》 · 卷 268 · 后梁纪3"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "zhu-wen-duan-meiren",
    "from": "zhu-wen",
    "to": "liang-duan-ning-sister-meiren",
    "kind": "kinship",
    "label": "宫廷美人",
    "note": "新史明确入侍后为美人，不补婚仪、册礼日或更高妃号。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v45",
        "paragraphId": "new-v45-p39",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "ef6c6c53c100150e366eb2f7ed6c9cdc5dca95bc30d4b98f610c0ffc8e66b7f5",
        "excerpt": "又以其妹內太祖，妹有色，後為美人。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 45 · 杂传"
      },
      {
        "chapterId": "old-v073",
        "paragraphId": "old-v073-p6",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "8c20aa4e05f7360e029a7ce984992d4786fa1713ffd7851c2aadd5963c776d68",
        "excerpt": "凝妹為梁祖美人，故稍委心腹。",
        "title": "《旧五代史》 · 卷 73 · 唐列传（毛璋、段凝等）"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "zhu-wen-princes-nurse",
    "from": "zhu-wen",
    "to": "liang-princes-nurse-kong-xun-mother",
    "kind": "service",
    "label": "诸子乳母",
    "note": "史载太祖诸儿乳母之一，不是朱温本人乳母，未指定其乳育哪一位皇子。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v43",
        "paragraphId": "new-v43-p29",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "4ee47b49df32779007e72e05d7de076bfa626bab5af7f2ad5927bdf31a19eddb",
        "excerpt": "太祖諸兒乳母有愛之者，養循為子，乳母之夫姓趙",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 43 · 杂传"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "nurse-kong-xun-adoption",
    "from": "liang-princes-nurse-kong-xun-mother",
    "to": "kong-xun",
    "kind": "adoption",
    "label": "养母与养子",
    "note": "养循为子有明确原文；不与李让先前养育阶段或孔循生母合并。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v43",
        "paragraphId": "new-v43-p29",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "4ee47b49df32779007e72e05d7de076bfa626bab5af7f2ad5927bdf31a19eddb",
        "excerpt": "稍長，給事太祖帳中，太祖諸兒乳母有愛之者，養循為子，乳母之夫姓趙，循又冒姓為趙氏，名殷衡。",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 43 · 杂传"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "zhang-quanyi-chu-marriage",
    "from": "zhang-quanyi",
    "to": "liang-zhang-quanyi-wife-chu",
    "kind": "kinship",
    "label": "夫妻",
    "note": "明确储氏为张全义妻；不据此自动推她为所有女儿的生母。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "old-v063",
        "paragraphId": "old-v063-p6",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "a1894641c56b6efd24c182ad562f2fb33cb7c340d62db348bdbb583f11cb4aaa",
        "excerpt": "全義妻儲氏，明敏有才略。",
        "title": "《旧五代史》 · 卷 63 · 唐列传"
      },
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v45",
        "paragraphId": "new-v45-p8",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "68a47bc774b71c7ca14547b5d4b20c8666a3b7b6c3415bc0b67d002cff8abdf5",
        "excerpt": "全義妻儲氏明敏有口辯，遽入見",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 45 · 杂传"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "chu-zhu-wen-intercession",
    "from": "liang-zhang-quanyi-wife-chu",
    "to": "zhu-wen",
    "kind": "conflict",
    "label": "为丈夫当面申辩",
    "note": "朱温猜忌或急召张全义时，储氏入见、厉声申辩；登记具体交涉，不把两人写成婚配或一般君臣从属。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "chapterId": "old-v063",
        "paragraphId": "old-v063-p6",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "a1894641c56b6efd24c182ad562f2fb33cb7c340d62db348bdbb583f11cb4aaa",
        "excerpt": "梁祖自柏鄉失律後，連年親征河朔，心疑全義，或左右讒間，儲氏每入宮，委曲伸理。",
        "title": "《旧五代史》 · 卷 63 · 唐列传"
      },
      {
        "chapterId": "new-v45",
        "paragraphId": "new-v45-p8",
        "originalRevision": 1,
        "originalSha256": "68a47bc774b71c7ca14547b5d4b20c8666a3b7b6c3415bc0b67d002cff8abdf5",
        "excerpt": "全義妻儲氏明敏有口辯，遽入見，厲聲曰：「宗奭，種田叟爾！守河南三十年，開荒斸土，捃拾財賦，助陛下創業，今年齒衰朽，已無能為，而陛下疑之，何也？」",
        "title": "《新五代史》 · 卷 45 · 杂传"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
